   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Cherry",
   "texto": [
    "To be sure: **Com certeza** (safely) or **certamente** (surely), **sem dúvida** (certainly). Example: **Sem dúvida, é verdade** (it is certainly true)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Doubt",
   "texto": [
    "To doubt: **Será que...?** or **talvez** (perhaps). Example: **Talvez seja verdade** (perhaps true). When **talvez** modifies a verb, the conjunctive is usually used; it does not depend on whether the doubt is great. Oral time provides nuances according to context."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Impossibility",
   "texto": [
    "To say that something cannot be: **É impossível que** + conjunctive: **É impossível que ele saiba** (it is impossible for you to know)."
   ]
